{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JON","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"約拿書","commonName":"約拿書","title":"約拿書","order":32,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"d5567522b3f36e56743f9863454e9d2be7a42b5e07aa66cbef79eee85bcfaa7c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JON/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JON/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":48},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["約拿的忿怒和上帝的憐憫"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["這事約拿大大不悅，且甚發怒，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["就禱告耶和華說：「耶和華啊，我在本國的時候豈不是這樣說嗎？我知道你是有恩典、有憐憫的上帝，不輕易發怒，有豐盛的慈愛，並且後悔不降所說的災，所以我急速逃往他施去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["耶和華啊，現在求你取我的命吧！因為我死了比活着還好。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["耶和華說：「你這樣發怒合乎理嗎？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["於是約拿出城，坐在城的東邊，在那裏為自己搭了一座棚，坐在棚的蔭下，要看看那城究竟如何。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["耶和華上帝安排一棵蓖麻，使其發生高過約拿，影兒遮蓋他的頭，救他脫離苦楚；約拿因這棵蓖麻大大喜樂。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["次日黎明，上帝卻安排一條蟲子咬這蓖麻，以致枯槁。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["日頭出來的時候，上帝安排炎熱的東風，日頭曝曬約拿的頭，使他發昏，他就為自己求死，說：「我死了比活着還好！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["上帝對約拿說：「你因這棵蓖麻發怒合乎理嗎？」他說：「我發怒以至於死，都合乎理！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和華說：「這蓖麻不是你栽種的，也不是你培養的；一夜發生，一夜乾死，你尚且愛惜；"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["何況這尼尼微大城，其中不能分辨左手右手的有十二萬多人，並有許多牲畜，我豈能不愛惜呢？」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/JON/4.json"